You no longer need to wrap your fingers, write in your hands, or use yellow paper to remind you of what is important.

RemSheet is for those little things you never remember: the hotel room number, the lock code, the number where you parked the car, or even your computer's unlock code.

You can view your RemSheets directly in the app, Widget, or Apple Watch. You can also choose which ones you want to see in the Widget and Apple Watch.

You can block access to the App by keeping your RemSheets protected from prying eyes. To unlock access to the App, use the Touch ID or Face ID. If your device does not support them, unlock with Username and Password.

As we often forget where the car was parked, with RemSheets just set the location where you park in the App or Watch, then the App indicates the way, and the distance, to him.

App Features:
• Add RemSheets with the keyboard;
• Use Siri to add spoken RemSheets;
• Add an Emoji to the RemSheet;
• Unlock the App with Password, Touch ID or Face ID;
• Define how you want RemSheets to appear in the App;
• Choose which RemSheets you want to see in the Widget and Apple Watch;
• Set the font, and its size, that you want to see in the Widget;
• Set the color of the text, and background, you want to see in Apple Watch;
• Restore, or permanently delete, your previously deleted RemSheets;
• Backup your RemSheets by giving them a name, and save them in the Files folder;
• Restore Backup from the Files folder, or from any other location;
• Define where you left the car parked, and then find the way to it;
• Help menu;
• One purchase. No advertising, and no app-in purchases.

Widget:
• View your RemSheets.

Apple Watch:
• View your RemSheets;
• Define the parking location of your car (you do not need to have the App active);
• Complications for quick access to RemSheet on Apple Watch.
